(6551951, 975201, 108069, '<td valign="top">The little squiggles of texture is a nice contrast to the colorful balloony spheres. A blend of impressionism and nursery-school-safe wall art. That''s a compliment by the way.</td>', 'The little squiggles of texture is a nice contrast to the colorful balloony spheres. A blend of impressionism and nursery-school-safe wall art. That''s a compliment by the way.', '2011-09-26 18:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
