(6552426, 975333, 108069, '<td valign="top">A geometrical wonder. Big tip of the hat for aligning this in the frame as you have. It''s reassuring the way the bits at the bottom and top line up perfectly, and the contrast line from shadow to light runs right to the corner. Wonderful depth despite it being a fairly simple composition, and the more time I spend with it I can trick myself as to which way is up, inside or out. Very cool image.</td>', 'A geometrical wonder. Big tip of the hat for aligning this in the frame as you have. It''s reassuring the way the bits at the bottom and top line up perfectly, and the contrast line from shadow to light runs right to the corner. Wonderful depth despite it being a fairly simple composition, and the more time I spend with it I can trick myself as to which way is up, inside or out. Very cool image.', '2011-09-27 06:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
