(6557990, 974605, 104009, '<td valign="top">7 from me.  i felt like this was a take on the whole "macro bubble" effect that is so popular, so it didn''t stand OUT for me.  however, i DID like the color and tones you used, they gave more depth to what was an overdone theme.  Your title didn''t help ME personally, because i felt many were trying a "puzzle macro" shot and your title screamed out "puzzle macro...guess@</td>', '7 from me.  i felt like this was a take on the whole "macro bubble" effect that is so popular, so it didn''t stand OUT for me.  however, i DID like the color and tones you used, they gave more depth to what was an overdone theme.  Your title didn''t help ME personally, because i felt many were trying a "puzzle macro" shot and your title screamed out "puzzle macro...guess@', '2011-10-02 03:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
